"# ① 在你现有 Clash 的 proxies: 下加这个节点\nproxies:\n  - name: tongdao-router\n    type: socks5\n    server: 127.0.0.1\n    port: 47231\n\n# ② 方式甲(推荐):订阅一份规则,绑新域名/IP 自动同步,之后不再动 Clash\nrule-providers:\n  tongdao-rules:\n    type: http\n    behavior: classical\n    format: yaml\n    url: http://127.0.0.1:47230/clash/vpn-rules.yaml\n    interval: 60\n    path: ./providers/tongdao-rules.yaml\n# rules: 顶部加一行引用(no-resolve 对清单内 IP-CIDR 生效)\n  - RULE-SET,tongdao-rules,tongdao-router,no-resolve\n\n# ② 方式乙:直接内联(不想用 provider 时)\n  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,corp.example.test,tongdao-router,no-resolve\n  - IP-CIDR,10.20.0.0/16,tongdao-router,no-resolve\n\n# ③ 无 Clash 时:把系统/浏览器代理指向 127.0.0.1:47231\n#    本工具自己分流:命中规则的走对应通道,其余走原网络。"
